[ceiling] The complete bay roof at Z284.674 is the lintel the pump cradle and its clamp slide in under at the factory, below the display/ridge storey. Support is accessible through the empty front bay before assembly. Its nominal opening is retained; physical support removal remains unqualified.
alternatives: Filling beneath the roof enters the cradle's insertion path. Sloping its full width changes the required bay opening and lintel section.
